    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Detonate\" title=\"Detonate\">Detonate</a></i> Force Power, you also damage enemies near the targeted object. Compare the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of all enemies within 2 squares of the object. If your check equals or exceeds the enemy's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, the enemy takes slashing damage equal to one-half the damage sustained by the object. This is an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>. </p>",
